{
  "schema": "qbit.prism.load-preset.v1",
  "name": "soak-weekly",
  "description": "The weekly long soak (#575): one server lifetime of about 5.5 h over the mainnet-shape-130-addresses cluster and population (two frontends, 400 sessions, a 400k window, retargeting tips, a 200 bps fee), looping the mainnet-shape-130-addresses, rental-churn-bursts-and-storms and tip-delivery-2000-miners-400k-2fe-retarget workloads (13 cycles of 25.5 min, no frontend restart, no degraded-database phase), with the share ledger rolled into a new partition four times and retention (seal, archive, verify, detach, drop) run every 10 min, sampled every minute and held to flat RSS and descriptors, no connection drift, bounded WAL, at least three rollovers and two archived partitions, zero lost shares and exact reconciliation.",
